    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relatively simple suspense puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into four independent chapters (to be added in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content is based on the four short stories of the same name in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio (Water Spraying/Corpse Transformation/Creating Animals/Testing the City God), but the content has been modified by me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to collect items and solve puzzles, and solve ghosts and monsters while ensuring their own survival, and then pass the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, small puzzle games and simple puzzle games do not have particularly scary plots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter has two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the ghosts and monsters, and get the pass ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be solved by the ghosts and monsters, and get the dead ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect clearance condition is to get two endings in all chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you like it^_^</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relatively simple suspense puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into four independent chapters (to be added in the future)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content is based on the four short stories of the same name in Strange Stories from a Chinese Studio (Water Spraying/Corpse Transformation/Creating Animals/Testing the City God), but the content has been modified by me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to collect items and solve puzzles, and solve ghosts and monsters while ensuring their own survival, and then pass the level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, small puzzle games and simple puzzle games do not have particularly scary plots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter has two endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the ghosts and monsters, and get the pass ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be solved by the ghosts and monsters, and get the dead ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect clearance condition is to get two endings in all chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you like it^_^</p>",
    "short_description": "A suspense puzzle game, similar to the Paper Wedding Dress series, with similar basic operations and gameplay. Players complete a series of mini games, decrypt them, and clear them. The plot of each chapter is independent of each other. Each chapter has a double ending of 'pass' and' dead '.",
